{"seq":2,"slug":"supply-chain-security-reshoring","title":"供应链安全、友岸外包与去风险化政策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/industrial-policy-strategic-trade-pe/evaluation-global-governance/supply-chain-security-reshoring","wordCount":3045,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"供应链安全-友岸外包与去风险化政策\">供应链安全、友岸外包与去风险化政策</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-从效率优先到韧性优先\">核心概念：从效率优先到韧性优先</h2><p>1990 至 2010 年代的全球价值链（GVC）扩张建立在一个默认假设上：企业按成本最小化选择供应商，政府只负责降低关税与运输壁垒。这一假设在 2018 年后被逐层打破——中美关税战、新冠疫情暴露的港口与芯片断供、2022 年俄乌冲突引发的能源与粮食冲击，使「效率优先」让位于「韧性优先」。供应链安全（supply chain security）由此从企业管理议题升级为国家战略议题：<strong>安全</strong>指关键投入品在危机中仍能获得，<strong>友岸外包</strong>（friend-shoring，源自美国财长耶伦 2022 年 4 月在大西洋理事会的演讲）指把采购转移到「可信赖伙伴国」，<strong>去风险</strong>（de-risking，欧盟委员会主席冯德莱恩 2023 年 3 月 30 日讲话提出「de-risk, not decouple」）则强调在「不脱钩」前提下降低对单一来源的过度依赖。四类策略的实质差别在<strong>地理与范围</strong>，而非口号。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[冲击 关税战/疫情/地缘冲突] --&gt; B[识别关键脆弱性&lt;br/&gt;集中度+替代难度]&#10;    B --&gt; C{策略选择}&#10;    C --&gt; D[回流 reshoring&lt;br/&gt;生产迁回本国]&#10;    C --&gt; E[近岸 nearshoring&lt;br/&gt;迁往邻近国家]&#10;    C --&gt; F[友岸 friend-shoring&lt;br/&gt;迁往盟伴国家]&#10;    C --&gt; G[去风险 de-risking&lt;br/&gt;多元化+储备+管制]&#10;    D --&gt; H[成本上升 韧性提升]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[再评估 效应与治理争议]\">graph TD\n    A[冲击 关税战/疫情/地缘冲突] --&gt; B[识别关键脆弱性&lt;br/&gt;集中度+替代难度]\n    B --&gt; C{策略选择}\n    C --&gt; D[回流 reshoring&lt;br/&gt;生产迁回本国]\n    C --&gt; E[近岸 nearshoring&lt;br/&gt;迁往邻近国家]\n    C --&gt; F[友岸 friend-shoring&lt;br/&gt;迁往盟伴国家]\n    C --&gt; G[去风险 de-risking&lt;br/&gt;多元化+储备+管制]\n    D --&gt; H[成本上升 韧性提升]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[再评估 效应与治理争议]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>地理指向</th>\n<th>主要工具</th>\n<th>典型代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>回流（reshoring）</td>\n<td>本国</td>\n<td>补贴、本地含量、采购优先</td>\n<td>单位成本最高，劳动力缺口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近岸（nearshoring）</td>\n<td>邻近低成本国</td>\n<td>自贸协定、物流投资</td>\n<td>仍需依赖他国，规模有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>友岸（friend-shoring）</td>\n<td>盟伴国</td>\n<td>协定、共同标准、出口信贷</td>\n<td>排除低成本非盟国，抬高总价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去风险（de-risking）</td>\n<td>不限定地理</td>\n<td>多元化、储备、出口管制、审查</td>\n<td>多元化本身有成本，管制引发反制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键区分在于：回流是<strong>地理上的内化</strong>，去风险是<strong>风险敞口的分散</strong>。企业可以把产能留在原地，只要把单一供应商拆成三家、把准时制（JIT）改为备货制，就已经在去风险——这解释了为何去风险比脱钩更可行，也解释了它为何常被批评为「换汤不换药」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"政策工具箱-补贴-关税-管制与审查的组合\">政策工具箱：补贴、关税、管制与审查的组合</h2><p>2022 年后的供应链政策不再依赖单一工具，而是<strong>补贴拉动产能 + 关税抬高对手成本 + 管制卡住技术 + 审查拦截资本</strong>的组合拳。</p>\n<p><strong>供给侧补贴</strong>以美国《芯片与科学法案》（CHIPS and Science Act, Public Law 117-167, 2022 年 8 月）为标志，提供约 527 亿美元的直接制造与研发拨款，外加 25% 的先进制造投资抵免（Section 48D）；欧盟《欧洲芯片法案》（Regulation (EU) 2023/1781）则动员约 430 亿欧元公私资金，目标是到 2030 年把欧盟全球芯片产能份额从约 10% 提升到 20%。<strong>关键原材料</strong>由欧盟《关键原材料法案》（CRMA, Regulation (EU) 2024/1252）设定 2030 年基准：本土开采满足 10%、加工 40%、回收 25% 的年需求，且<strong>任一第三国对任一战略原材料的供应不得超过 65%</strong>——这是把「集中度上限」直接写入法规的少见做法。欧盟《净零工业法案》（NZIA, Regulation (EU) 2024/1735）进一步要求本土制造满足 2030 年部署需求的 40%，并在拍卖中引入非价格韧性标准。</p>\n<p><strong>需求侧与贸易侧</strong>由关税承担。美国贸易代表办公室（USTR）在 2024 年 5 月完成对华 301 关税四年期复审，把中国产电动汽车关税提高到 100%、太阳能电池 50%、半导体 50%、钢铝 25%；欧盟则于 2024 年 10 月 29 日对中国产纯电动车征收最终反补贴税，在 10% 基础关税之上加征最高约 35.3%。<strong>资本流动</strong>由对外投资审查覆盖：美国财政部依 2023 年 8 月第 14105 号行政令，于 2024 年 10 月发布最终规则，自 2025 年 1 月 2 日起对半导体与微电子、量子信息、人工智能三个领域的对华（及港澳）出境投资实施禁止或通报。<strong>关键技术</strong>仍由<a href=\"../strategic-trade-instruments/export-controls-sanctions-toolkit\">出口管制与制裁工具箱</a>承担，与补贴构成「推」与「堵」的两侧。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>代表政策</th>\n<th>落点</th>\n<th>作用方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>制造补贴</td>\n<td>美国 CHIPS（527 亿美元）、欧盟芯片法案（约 430 亿欧元）</td>\n<td>产能落地</td>\n<td>拉动本国投资</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原材料基准</td>\n<td>欧盟 CRMA（10/40/25 + 单一国 65% 上限）</td>\n<td>上游依赖</td>\n<td>限制集中度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关税</td>\n<td>美国 301 复审（EV 100%）、欧盟对华 BEV 反补贴税</td>\n<td>进口成本</td>\n<td>抬高对手份额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出境投资审查</td>\n<td>美国第 14105 号行政令最终规则（2025-01-02 生效）</td>\n<td>资本外流</td>\n<td>阻断技术转移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中国的反制构成工具箱的另一半：2023 年 8 月起对镓、锗实施出口许可，12 月起覆盖石墨，2024 年 9 月起纳入锑——这些品种的共同点是<strong>中国在上游加工掌握高份额</strong>，属于节点权力的反用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"经济学机理-韧性溢价与去风险的量化\">经济学机理：韧性溢价与去风险的量化</h2><p>把供应链安全写成可比较的量，需要区分<strong>概率 × 损失</strong>两维。设某关键投入品在危机中断供的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，断供造成的产出损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，则该环节的风险敞口为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EL</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Exposure</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EL} = p \\cdot L \\cdot \\text{Exposure}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EL</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Exposure</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Exposure</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Exposure}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Exposure</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是对该来源的采购占比。去风险（把占比从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）带来的期望损失下降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>EL</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\text{EL} = p \\cdot L \\cdot (s_1 - s_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EL</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，而付出的额外采购成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。政策理性的判据是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>EL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C &lt; \\Delta \\text{EL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EL</span></span></span></span></span></span>，即<strong>买保险的钱少于期望损失</strong>。这一不等式解释了为什么对不同环节的态度差异巨大：先进逻辑芯片的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 极高（停产一次损失以数十亿美元计）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 又因为地理集中而偏高，因此愿意付极高的韧性溢价；而普通消费品的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 都低，回流就毫无经济性。</p>\n<p>集中度用赫芬达尔—赫希曼指数（HHI）刻画：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HHI</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HHI} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} s_i^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HHI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个来源国的份额。单一来源时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HHI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HHI}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HHI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（极端脆弱），均分给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 国时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HHI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HHI}=1/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HHI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。台积电占全球最先进制程（10 纳米以下）产能约九成（据半导体产业协会 SIA 与 TrendForce 数据），HHI 接近 1；稀土精炼环节中国占全球约九成（据 IEA《Global Critical Minerals Outlook》口径），同为接近 1 的结构——这正是各国同时补贴本土产能的动机。但多国补贴叠加会<strong>催生产能过剩与重复建设</strong>：各国都要求本土份额，全球总产能超出实际需求，价格战与财政沉没成本随之而来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"效应评估-成本-通胀与-被排除的中间\">效应评估：成本、通胀与「被排除的中间」</h2><p>对去风险化政策的量化评估在 2023 年后密集出现，结论是<strong>净成本为正但量级取决于协调程度</strong>。国际货币基金组织（IMF, 2023 年《Geoeconomic Fragmentation and the Future of Multilateralism》）估计，若全球贸易沿地缘阵营彻底分裂为两个集团，长期全球产出损失约为全球 GDP 的 2%（部分含技术扩散受阻的估计高达 7%）；世界贸易组织（WTO）在 2023 年《World Trade Report》中给出类似量级，并强调<strong>技术扩散放慢</strong>是比关税更持久的代价。这背后的机制是：贸易不只是换货，还是<strong>知识与工艺的载体</strong>，供应链断裂会同时减少生产率溢出。</p>\n<p>分配后果比总量更不均。受冲击最大的是**「被排除的中间」<strong>——既不属于美欧盟伴、也无力成为替代节点的发展中国家：它们面临更高的准入门槛（原产地规则、ESG 与劳动标准、友岸审查），同时失去规模效应。相对受益者是</strong>「连接器国家」<strong>：越南、墨西哥、印度、波兰等在 2018 年后对美出口份额上升，承接了部分绕道产能——中美直接贸易份额下降的同时，经第三国的间接贸易上升，说明</strong>关税与友岸规则改变了贸易路径，而非消灭了贸易**。</p>\n<p>另一重效应在<strong>价格与库存</strong>。准时制被「准时制 + 安全库存」替代，库存周转下降、占用资本上升，成本部分转嫁给消费者；2024 年红海航运中断推高亚欧航线运价，说明韧性代价会以通胀形式显现。评估政策成败因此需要两个反事实：<strong>没有政策时危机会造成多大损失</strong>，以及<strong>政策是否只是把风险从一处搬到另一处</strong>（把对华依赖换成对单一盟国的依赖，HHI 并未下降）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全球治理-从多边纪律到-小院高墙-俱乐部\">全球治理：从多边纪律到「小院高墙」俱乐部</h2><p>供应链安全政策对以 WTO 为核心的多边贸易体制构成结构性压力，其表现是<strong>纪律被绕过、规则重心外移</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，安全例外被频繁援引。</strong> GATT 第 XXI 条允许成员为「基本安全利益」采取必要措施，但该条款长期被视为自裁决且少有判例；一旦各国普遍用它为产业政策辩护，关税与出口管制的纪律约束就被显著削弱。争端解决上诉机构的停摆（2019 年底起因美国阻挠任命而无法运转）使这一趋势缺少纠错机制——这也是各国转向「对等措施」而非诉讼的原因，欧盟《反经济胁迫工具》（Regulation (EU) 2023/2675）即为典型：它授权对以经济手段施压的第三国采取关税、采购限制等措施，而非诉诸多边裁决。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，规则重心从多边转向诸边与双边俱乐部。</strong> 美国主导的「印太经济框架」（IPEF）于 2023 年 5 月达成供应链协议、2024 年 2 月生效，14 个成员建立供应链理事会与危机响应网络；《区域全面经济伙伴关系协定》（RCEP，2022 年 1 月生效）与 CPTPP 整合亚太原产地规则，二者重叠交叉形成「意大利面碗」式叠加，企业合规成本上升。治理对象也从「边界措施」扩展到「边界内政策」——补贴、产业政策、数据与劳工标准被纳入协定，等于把<a href=\"../implementation-state-capacity/state-capacity-industrial-governance\">产业政策的国内执行能力</a>变成国际谈判筹码。</p>\n<p>治理上的核心张力在于<strong>韧性的公共品属性</strong>：一条抗冲击的全球供应链让所有人受益，加固成本却由各国自担，于是理性选择是「让别人去多元化、自己搭便车」。这解释了为什么友岸与去风险多停留在宣言层面，而补贴与管制却快速落地——前者需要协调，后者只需本国财政与行政权力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>概念分层</strong>：供应链安全是目标，回流/近岸/友岸/去风险是四种地理—范围不同的手段；去风险不等于脱钩，后者成本高到多数国家无法承受。</li>\n<li><strong>工具是组合拳</strong>：补贴拉产能（CHIPS 527 亿美元、欧盟芯片法案约 430 亿欧元）、关税抬对手（美国 301 复审 EV 100%、欧盟对华 BEV 反补贴税）、审查拦资本（美国第 14105 号行政令，2025-01-02 生效）、管制卡技术，四者相互强化。</li>\n<li><strong>判据可量化</strong>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EL</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Exposure</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EL} = p \\cdot L \\cdot \\text{Exposure}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EL</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Exposure</span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量风险敞口，HHI 衡量集中度；政策理性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>EL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C &lt; \\Delta \\text{EL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EL</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>效应评估</strong>：IMF 与 WTO 估计全面分裂的长期损失约为全球 GDP 的 2%（技术扩散受阻情形更高）；分配上「被排除的中间」受损、连接器国家（越南、墨西哥、印度）受益。</li>\n<li><strong>治理走向</strong>：安全例外滥用与争端机制停摆削弱多边纪律，规则重心转向 IPEF、RCEP 等俱乐部与欧盟反胁迫工具等单边措施，合规成本上升。</li>\n<li><strong>本 hub 内的坐标</strong>：本节承接<a href=\"../strategic-trade-instruments/export-controls-sanctions-toolkit\">出口管制与制裁工具箱</a>的物项—资金—股权三分法，并把评估落到<a href=\"../implementation-state-capacity/state-capacity-industrial-governance\">国家能力与产业治理</a>的执行侧。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"供应链安全、友岸外包与去风险化政策","id":"供应链安全-友岸外包与去风险化政策"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从效率优先到韧性优先","id":"核心概念-从效率优先到韧性优先"},{"level":2,"text":"政策工具箱：补贴、关税、管制与审查的组合","id":"政策工具箱-补贴-关税-管制与审查的组合"},{"level":2,"text":"经济学机理：韧性溢价与去风险的量化","id":"经济学机理-韧性溢价与去风险的量化"},{"level":2,"text":"效应评估：成本、通胀与「被排除的中间」","id":"效应评估-成本-通胀与-被排除的中间"},{"level":2,"text":"全球治理：从多边纪律到「小院高墙」俱乐部","id":"全球治理-从多边纪律到-小院高墙-俱乐部"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"产业政策效果的计量评估：DID、事件研究与结构模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/industrial-policy-strategic-trade-pe/evaluation-global-governance/policy-evaluation-methods"},"next":{"title":"地缘经济碎片化与全球贸易规则治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/industrial-policy-strategic-trade-pe/evaluation-global-governance/geoeconomic-fragmentation-governance"}}